          "end_column": 16,
          "symbol": "ConvolutionalAutoencoder.forward",
          "expression": "def forward(self, x):\n    x = self.conv_1(x)\n    x = F.leaky_relu(x)\n    x = self.conv_2(x)\n    x = F.leaky_relu(x)\n    x = self.deconv_1(x)\n    x = F.leaky_relu(x)\n    x = self.deconv_2(x)\n    x = F.leaky_relu(x)\n    x = x[:, :, :-1, :-1]\n    x = torch.sigmoid(x)\n    return x"
        }
      ],
